{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"482721","name":"Sensitive Premium Resort & Spa","description":"Boasting an indoor and outdoor swimming pool and a private beach area, Sensitive Premium Resort & Spa is located at beachfront and features sleek and stylish décor. Spa & wellness centre, sauna and a Turkish bath are available for the guests for a relaxing holiday. There is also a water park on-site. Free WiFi is available. Featuring a balcony, air conditioning, minibar and a kettle, all rooms come with a TV with satellite channels. Some units have a seating area where you can relax. You can enjoy a cup of teof activities ranging from windsurfing and diving to mini golf. You will find a 24-hour front desk service besides bike hire at the property. Free on-site private parking is available. A la Carte Restaurant , outdoor swimmingpool , beach, snacks will be closed between 01. 11 - 31. 03 for every year. A la Carte Restaurant in summer only for 1 week accomodation in 1 restaurant reservierung. Koprulu Canyon National Park is 47 km from Sensitive Premium Resort & Spa, while Antalya city centre is 49 km from the property. The nearest airport is Antalya Airport, 40 km from the accommodation.","address":"Boğazkent, Alparslan Cad. No.23/1 Belek Boğazkent, 23/1","city":"BELEK","countryCode":"TR","postalCode":"7500","lat":36.84015,"lng":31.1374463,"stars":5,"giataCode":"530723","phone":"+902427310700","email":"INFO@SENSITIVEPREMIUM.COM","website":"www.sensitivepremium.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/48/482721/482721a_hb_a_004.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/48/482721/482721a_hb_a_001.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/48/482721/482721a_hb_a_002.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/48/482721/482721a_hb_a_007.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com